tasks.description:
新建 crates/middleware-runtime crate（无 GPUI 依赖，组织方式参考 crates/mqtt-runtime：lib.rs+types.rs+connection.rs，rust_i18n 指向 ../middleware_view/locales）。

【背景】本任务是中间件标准化的契约层，rocketmq-runtime 与 middleware_view 都依赖它。标准属性提取自 RocketMQ Console（apache/rocketmq-dashboard）的页面模型，需让 MQTT/RocketMQ 都能表达（能力位降级）。

【要求】
1. MiddlewareCapabilities：topics / topic_write / groups / clients / message_query / send_message / metrics / cluster_overview 布尔能力位（derive Default）。
2. 标准数据模型（全部 pub，serde Serialize/Deserialize，字段中文文档注释）：
   - MiddlewareTopicInfo{name, topic_type: Option<String>(NORMAL/FIFO/DELAY/TRANSACTION/RETRY/DLQ/SYSTEM/SUBSCRIPTION 等通用文本), queue_count: Option<u32>, perm: Option<String>(读写权限文本), message_count: Option<u64>, description: Option<String>, created_at: Option<String>}
   - QueueStat{broker, queue_id: i32, min_offset: i64, max_offset: i64, last_update: Option<String>}；TopicDetail{topic, stats: Vec<QueueStat>}
   - MiddlewareGroupInfo{group, client_count: Option<u32>, consume_type: Option<String>(PUSH/PULL/BROADCAST), message_model: Option<String>(CLUSTERING/BROADCASTING), tps: Option<f64>, total_diff: Option<i64>(堆积), version: Option<String>, update_time: Option<String>}
   - MiddlewareClientInfo{client_id, client_addr: Option<String>, language: Option<String>, version: Option<String>, subscriptions: Vec<String>}
   - GroupConsumeDetail{group, queues: Vec<GroupQueueStat{topic, broker, queue_id, broker_offset, consumer_offset, diff}>}
   - MiddlewareMessage{message_id, topic, tag: Option<String>, key: Option<String>, body: Option<Vec<u8>>, body_text: Option<String>, store_time: Option<String>, born_time: Option<String>, store_host: Option<String>, born_host: Option<String>, retry_times: Option<u32>, properties: Vec<(String,String)>}
   - MessageQuery 枚举：ByTimeWindow{topic, begin_unix_ms, end_unix_ms, page, page_size} | ByKey{topic, key} | ById{topic, message_id}；MessagePage{messages: Vec<MiddlewareMessage>, total, has_more}
   - ClusterOverview{clusters: Vec<ClusterInfo{name, brokers: Vec<BrokerInfo{name, address, topic_count, queue_count, version, tps_in, tps_out}>}>}
   - MiddlewareMetrics{tps_in, tps_out, topic_count, connection_count, message_count_today, extras: Vec<(String,String)>}
   - SendMessageRequest{topic, tag: Option<String>, key: Option<String>, body: Vec<u8>, properties: Vec<(String,String)>}；SendResult{message_id, status}
   - CreateTopicRequest{topic, topic_type, queue_count, perm, attributes: Vec<(String,String)>}
3. MiddlewareError（Config/Protocol/Unsupported/Timeout/Connection/Auth）+ std Error 实现。
4. #[async_trait] pub trait MiddlewareAdmin: Send + Sync { fn capabilities(&self)->MiddlewareCapabilities; async fn cluster_overview; async fn metrics_snapshot; async fn list_topics; async fn topic_detail(topic); async fn create_topic(req); async fn update_topic(req); async fn delete_topic(topic); async fn send_message(req); async fn list_groups; async fn group_clients(group); async fn group_detail(group); async fn query_messages(query); async fn message_detail(topic, message_id) }——返回 Result<_, MiddlewareError>；能力位声明为 false 的方法由调用方保证不调用（UI 隐藏入口）。
5. workspace Cargo.toml members 注册；crate 仅依赖 anyhow/serde/async-trait 等基础依赖（参考 mqtt-runtime 的 Cargo.toml 精简度）。
6. 单测：模型 serde 往返 + MessageQuery 变体序列化 + capabilities Default。
7. cargo fmt / clippy -p middleware-runtime --deny warnings / test -p middleware-runtime 全绿。
